bility they effect.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942510/extras/66c09880c0a6c3fa487f64290b6362af.avif?t=1732698112\" /></div><br>You can use one handed sword and shield for now. Other weapons will be added in the early access. You can also hire mercenaries from the tavern.<br><br><i>Other Features</i><br>You can explore the villages, forest, mountains. There are ores to mine, herbs to collect, animals to hunt. You can talk with the villagers, to learn about the history, get quests, trade and so on.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942510/extras/1e246dbc776037cca41be47a49e2edb8.avif?t=1732698112\" /></div>",
